window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-002-d5320b8b89c0d01d.json"]={sha256:"d5320b8b89c0d01d3dd04ca02da54c4bbcc106530f78f7fd6ca048ad6a593c50",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-3c67d91571cd08ae","url":"https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spire-about/spire-concepts/","title":"SPIRE Concepts and workload registration","titleEn":"SPIRE Concepts and workload registration","publisher":"SPIFFE","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-002","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-002","related":[{"id":"security-v27-003","referenceUrls":["https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spiffe-specs/x509-svid/"],"title":"X509-SVID：單一 URI 身分與換證重疊","titleEn":"X509-SVID: single-URI identity and renewal overlap","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：12筆皆有唯一身分與逐條判定，5筆變7筆可追溯；節點認證成功不被當成工作負載選擇器全部成立。 交付12列selector-matrix.csv、註冊版本差異與兩筆新增授權的審查理由；記錄撤回新摘要後的預期集合。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: All 12 rows have unique identities and explicit decisions; the change from five to seven is traceable. Successful node attestation never substitutes for matching all workload selectors. Deliver the 12-row selector matrix, registration-version diff and justification for the two new grants. Record the exact expected set after withdrawing the added digest.","difference":"製作正常葉憑證、雙URI SAN、CA旗標開啟及錯信任域四份描述檔；不產生真實密鑰。畫出舊憑證到期、新憑證可用與應用reload的三時刻。","differenceEn":"Prepare descriptors for a valid leaf, two URI SANs, an enabled CA flag and a wrong trust domain, without generating real keys. Plot old expiry, new availability and application reload.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["選擇器必須共同成立；重複觀測同一程序不能增加可授權程序數。用明列的集合交集對照註冊條目，並將節點認證與工作負載認證分層。 namespace與service account共同符合的程序有8筆，其中5筆映像摘要也符合；變更摘要白名單後另有2筆符合，母體仍12筆。 初始可授權比例5/12×100=41.6666667%；修訂後7/12×100=58.3333333%，其餘不得因同節點就取得此身分。","完成標準鏈結驗證仍不代表SVID專屬檢查通過；時間餘裕只衡量已驗證的新憑證能否在舊證到期前被應用採用。 舊證在t=900秒到期，新證t=620可用，驗證與reload共需70秒；延遲案例把新證可用時間改成760秒。 餘裕900−620−70=210秒；延遲後900−760−70=70秒。格式不合格時兩個正餘裕都不能當作允許理由。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Required selectors must hold together; observing a process twice does not create another eligible process. Compare explicit set intersections with registration entries while separating node attestation from workload attestation. Eight processes jointly match namespace and service account; five also match the image digest. An approved digest-list revision admits two more of those eight, while the population remains 12. Eligible share is 5/12×100=41.6666667%; the revision yields 7/12×100=58.3333333%. Remaining processes must not receive the identity merely because they share a node.","Passing ordinary certificate-path validation does not imply the SVID-specific checks pass. Timing margin measures whether an already validated replacement can be adopted before the old credential expires. The old credential expires at t=900 seconds; its replacement is available at 620 and validation plus reload takes 70 seconds. A delayed fixture changes replacement availability to 760. Margin is 900−620−70=210 seconds, falling to 70 with delayed availability. Neither positive margin authorizes a replacement that fails identity or leaf-format validation.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-012","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6960.html"],"title":"OCSP：狀態回應的觀測時間與過期證據","titleEn":"OCSP: observation time and stale status evidence","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：12筆皆有唯一身分與逐條判定，5筆變7筆可追溯；節點認證成功不被當成工作負載選擇器全部成立。 交付12列selector-matrix.csv、註冊版本差異與兩筆新增授權的審查理由；記錄撤回新摘要後的預期集合。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: All 12 rows have unique identities and explicit decisions; the change from five to seven is traceable. Successful node attestation never substitutes for matching all workload selectors. Deliver the 12-row selector matrix, registration-version diff and justification for the two new grants. Record the exact expected set after withdrawing the added digest.","difference":"建立已撤銷、未知、過期good與新鮮good四類描述；記錄憑證識別、授權回應者與簽章結果，讓應用層能區分狀態拒絕及無法取得可信狀態。","differenceEn":"Build revoked, unknown, stale-good and fresh-good descriptors. Record certificate identity, authorized responder and signature result so the application can distinguish a negative status from failure to obtain trustworthy status evidence.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["選擇器必須共同成立；重複觀測同一程序不能增加可授權程序數。用明列的集合交集對照註冊條目，並將節點認證與工作負載認證分層。 namespace與service account共同符合的程序有8筆，其中5筆映像摘要也符合；變更摘要白名單後另有2筆符合，母體仍12筆。 初始可授權比例5/12×100=41.6666667%；修訂後7/12×100=58.3333333%，其餘不得因同節點就取得此身分。","本地課堂政策要求觀測時間不晚於nextUpdate，且thisUpdate年齡不超過900秒；900秒是教學設定，沒有將它宣稱為RFC通用預設。 thisUpdate設為0秒，nextUpdate為1200秒，觀測時刻600秒；將兩條時間限制各自換成相對觀測時刻的剩餘預算。 可用新鮮度餘裕min(1200−600,900−600)=300秒；觀測推進到850秒後餘裕為50秒，仍需先通過身分與簽章檢查。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Required selectors must hold together; observing a process twice does not create another eligible process. Compare explicit set intersections with registration entries while separating node attestation from workload attestation. Eight processes jointly match namespace and service account; five also match the image digest. An approved digest-list revision admits two more of those eight, while the population remains 12. Eligible share is 5/12×100=41.6666667%; the revision yields 7/12×100=58.3333333%. Remaining processes must not receive the identity merely because they share a node.","The classroom policy requires observation no later than nextUpdate and thisUpdate age no greater than 900 seconds. That 900-second bound is a selected local policy, not a universal RFC default or evidence that every responder updates at that rate. Set thisUpdate to zero, nextUpdate to 1200 seconds and observation to 600 seconds. Convert the next-update limit and the local maximum-age limit into separate budgets relative to the observation instant. Freshness margin is min(1200−600, 900−600)=300 seconds. Moving observation to 850 leaves 50 seconds. Positive arithmetic does not authorize a response signed by an unrelated responder.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-0ece97d2d1781067","url":"https://spiffe.io/docs/latest/spiffe-specs/x509-svid/","title":"SPIFFE X509-SVID specification","titleEn":"SPIFFE X509-SVID specification","publisher":"SPIFFE","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-cb4da715902c139e","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6960.html","title":"RFC 6960: Online Certificate Status Protocol","titleEn":"RFC 6960: Online Certificate Status Protocol","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
